    "text": "1 days ago MEREDITH — Granite VNA will offer “Memory, Mix & Mingle” on Wednesday, June 10. Memory Mix & Mingle is a welcoming gathering space for individuals living with cognitive impairment and their friends, family members, and caregivers. It’s a safe, supportive environment designed to foster connection, laughter, and meaningful moments together. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
